==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Fire Chuchu}}
Fire Chuchus reappear, acting the same as in {{BotW}}. [[Gloom-Wreathed Enemy|Gloom-Wreathed]] variants are also present in the [[Depths]], typically appearing in fiery locations such as the [[Eldin Canyon Depths]].

==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
Fie Chuchus reappear in {{AoC}}, first appearing in. They act the same as in {{BotW}} and drop [[Red Chuchu Jelly]] upon their defeat once again. Their [[Giant Chuchu|Giant]] variants reappear during [[Battle]]s added in the {{PotA}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack. These Fire Chuchus attack [[Warrior]]s by rolling around, spinning their bodies, slamming down into the ground, and releasing small Fire Chuchus.
{{Noncanon|End}}

